  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>fondaparinux</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>B01AX05</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Michaličková D et al. 2022</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>dialysis-dependent chronic kidney disease patients</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>fondaparinux</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_fondaparinux/Fondaparinux_Michalikov2022_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>clearance (CL)</td><td>0.05289</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>volume of distribution (Vd)</td><td>5.55</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr></table><h4>About fondaparinux</h4><p>Fondaparinux is an antithrombotic drug used to treat and prevent blood clots, including pulmonary embolism, thrombosis, thrombophlebitis, and phlebitis. It is an approved antithrombotic, classified among other antithrombotic agents, and has also been studied investigationally.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q27077698\">Wikidata Q27077698</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Fondaparinux\">Fondaparinux</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Michaličková D et al. (2022). Population pharmacokinetics-pharmacodynamics of fondaparinux in dialysis-dependent chronic kidney disease patients undergoing chronic renal replacement therapy. <i>European journal of clinical pharmacology 78(1):89–98</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00228-021-03201-1\">10.1007/s00228-021-03201-1</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34414464\">34414464</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Michaličková_2022: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
